        caption="A crude sketch to settle what the page is for, a clean wireframe to settle where things go, then the same wireframe with the decisions written onto it. The third pass is the one that did the work: it records why a row scrolls horizontally in sync, and why empty rows are pre-rendered rather than drawn on demand."
      />
    </Container>

    <Container width="wide" class="mt-16">
      <Plate
